-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE: WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

THIS LICENCE COVERS THE CODE IN THIS REPOSITORY ONLY.

It covers the scripts, the tooling, the configuration and the prose written for
this artifact. It grants nothing whatsoever over any third-party material this
artifact reads, measures, or was derived from.

DERIVED CORPORA ARE NEVER REDISTRIBUTED.

No dataset, corpus, document collection, extract, index, embedding set, or model
weight derived from a third-party source is distributed under this licence, and
none is committed to this repository. What this artifact ships instead is the
means to rebuild the set: the extraction script, the frozen id lists naming
exactly which records were used, and the recorded fetch date. A reader who wants
the data obtains it from the original source, under that source's terms.

EACH DATA SOURCE'S OWN ATTRIBUTION AND LICENCE GOVERNS ITS MATERIAL.

Where this artifact measures third-party material, the source is named in the
README's data section together with its URL, its licence, and the date it was
fetched, and the source's own attribution block is carried with it. Those terms
are not superseded by this file and nothing here relaxes them. Where a source's
licence and this one appear to conflict over the source's material, the source's
licence governs.

MODEL WEIGHTS AND CONTAINER IMAGES ARE NOT REDISTRIBUTED EITHER.

They are referenced by digest so that a reader can pull the identical bytes from
the original registry. The reference is not a sublicence, and each remains
subject to its own terms.
